  ObjectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dd364534e152cb64f853653b3bce2547, type: 3}
  Facts:
  - text: "The Ocean\u2019s Spiky Ball!\nSea urchins look like little balls covered
      in sharp spines, but those spines help them move, protect, and clean themselves!\nThey
      crawl slowly across rocks using tiny tube feet hidden underneath.\nWith a mouth
      on the bottom called \u201CAristotle\u2019s lantern,\u201D they scrape algae
      off surfaces\u2014like ocean lawnmowers!\nSome even wear seashells and rocks
      as camouflage hats!"
